    "text": "1 hours ago Scranton, Pa. — On Wednesday evening, the Marywood University women's basketball hosted Elmira College in a tightly contested matchup. The Pacers (4-3) came out victorious, grabbing the 66-62 win over the Soaring Eagles. Marywood had the edge after quarters one and two, taking a 35-29 lead into the half. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
